11:08.520 --> 11:09.890
I have an older sister... Wait-

11:09.890 --> 11:10.440
I have an older sister... Wait-

11:11.140 --> 11:12.980
Don't leave all the talking to me!

11:13.190 --> 11:14.310
More importantly, you're-

11:18.690 --> 11:19.740
It's okay.

11:20.400 --> 11:21.610
