16:15.530 --> 16:16.990
That doesn't matter!

16:18.370 --> 16:19.790
Doesn't matter?

16:20.500 --> 16:23.210
If I stay with you, you'll just grow to hate me.

16:23.210 --> 16:25.960
If I stay with you, you'll just grow to hate me.

16:31.800 --> 16:32.590
